      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#what-the-class-is" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. What the Class Is</a>
          <a href="#what-it-runs" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. What It Runs</a>
          <a href="#space-heater" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. What It Won't Run</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Our Picks</a>
          <a href="#weight" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Weight</a>
          <a href="#use-cases" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Camping vs Outage</a>
          <a href="#parallel" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Parallel Kits</a>
          <a href="#fuel-runtime-noise" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Fuel & Noise</a>
          <a href="#safety" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. Safety</a>
          <a href="#mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. Common Mistakes</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">11. FAQ</a>
        </nav>
